[
  {
    "id": "EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_1",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "도사 양반, 늦었소.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\event\\shaman_quest.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_1.wav",
    "duration": 2.05,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_2",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "할매, 술부터… 아, 분위기 아니구먼.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\event\\shaman_quest.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_2.wav",
    "duration": 3.0,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_3",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "봉인이 흔들리오. 못골 아래로 요기가 새고 있소.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\event\\shaman_quest.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_3.wav",
    "duration": 3.95,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_4",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "흑랑 굴 끝에 구미호의 수하가 자리를 잡았고, 봉밀굴 안은… 아직 잠든 것이 낫소.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\event\\shaman_quest.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_4.wav",
    "duration": 6.3,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_5",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "…또 봉인이여.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\event\\shaman_quest.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_5.wav",
    "duration": 1.45,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_6",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "도사 양반밖에 없소. 내려가 베어 주시오.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\event\\shaman_quest.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_6.wav",
    "duration": 3.85,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_7",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "술값은—",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\event\\shaman_quest.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_7.wav",
    "duration": 1.25,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_8",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "살아서 돌아오면 쳐 드리리다.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\event\\shaman_quest.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_8.wav",
    "duration": 2.75,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_9",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "…허. 하는 김에.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\event\\shaman_quest.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\EV_SHAMAN_QUEST_9.wav",
    "duration": 1.65,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_FIRST_1",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "떠돌이 도사가 웬일이오.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_FIRST_1.wav",
    "duration": 1.6,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_FIRST_2",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "못골 장터가 닫힌 지 석 달이오.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_FIRST_2.wav",
    "duration": 2.1,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_AFTER_1",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "베었구려! 못골이 오랜만에 숨을 쉬겠소.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_AFTER_1.wav",
    "duration": 3.0,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_THANKS_NUDGE",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "사례는 받아 가시오. 빈손으로 보내면 내 잠자리가 편치 않소.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_THANKS_NUDGE.wav",
    "duration": 3.95,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_CLEAR_DONE_1",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "간밤엔 굴 쪽이 조용했소. …도사 양반 솜씨요?",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_CLEAR_DONE_1.wav",
    "duration": 3.15,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_CLEAR_DONE_2",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "산책 좀 했지.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_ELDER_CLEAR_DONE_2.wav",
    "duration": 1.5,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_CLEAR_ACTIVE_1",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "간밤에도 굴 어귀에서 뭔가 울었소. 아직 남았구려.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_CLEAR_ACTIVE_1.wav",
    "duration": 3.1,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_CLEAR_ACTIVE_2",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "어귀만 비우면 되오. 끝까지 가란 말이 아니오.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_CLEAR_ACTIVE_2.wav",
    "duration": 2.95,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_OFFER_AGAIN",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "굴 어귀 일, 생각해 보셨소?",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_OFFER_AGAIN.wav",
    "duration": 2.15,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_ACTIVE_1",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "무당 할매 말씀은 믿어도 되오. 그분이 틀린 적은 없소.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_ACTIVE_1.wav",
    "duration": 3.3,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_ACTIVE_2",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "굴 끝까지 가신다니… 부디 무리하지 마시오.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_ACTIVE_2.wav",
    "duration": 2.6,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_OFFER_1",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "부탁이 하나 있소. 흑랑 굴 말이오.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_OFFER_1.wav",
    "duration": 2.2,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_OFFER_2",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "밤마다 어귀에서 것들이 기어 나와 밭을 헤집고 외양간을 비우오.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_OFFER_2.wav",
    "duration": 4.3,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_OFFER_3",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "끝까지는 바라지도 않소. 첫 층만… 비워 주시오.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_OFFER_3.wav",
    "duration": 3.1,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_OFFER_4",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "첫 층만? 그럼 산책이구먼.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_ELDER_OFFER_4.wav",
    "duration": 2.3,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_GREET_1",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "떠돌이 도사가 웬일이오.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_GREET_1.wav",
    "duration": 1.7,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_GREET_2",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "못골 장터가 닫힌 지 석 달이오.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_GREET_2.wav",
    "duration": 2.0,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_GREET_3",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "요괴병에 장정 셋을 잃었소.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_GREET_3.wav",
    "duration": 2.1,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_GREET_4",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "젊은이들은 떠났고, 남은 건 걱정뿐이오.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_GREET_4.wav",
    "duration": 2.7,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_ACCEPT_1",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "그 산책, 부디 무사히 끝내시오.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_ACCEPT_1.wav",
    "duration": 2.1,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_REPORT_1",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "몇 해 전 묵어 간 도사가 두고 간 책이 한 권 있소. 우리 집안은 까막눈이라…",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_REPORT_1.wav",
    "duration": 4.35,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_REPORT_2",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "글은 내가 좀 읽지.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_ELDER_REPORT_2.wav",
    "duration": 1.95,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_REPORT_3",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "가져가시오. 굴 어귀 값이오.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_REPORT_3.wav",
    "duration": 1.85,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_THANKS_1",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "약소하지만… 받으시오.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_THANKS_1.wav",
    "duration": 1.6,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_ELDER_AFTER_2",
    "speaker": "elder",
    "text": "고맙소. …구미호는 아직 북쪽 산길 끝, 봉밀굴 문 너머에 있소. 잊지 마시오.",
    "voice_name": "Sungbae",
    "voice_id": "tc_5d01a52bbb04140008a23f37",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\elder.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\elder\\NPC_ELDER_AFTER_2.wav",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_FIRST_1",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "도사 양반, 목이나 축이고 가시구려. 술은… 없어도 국물은 있지.",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_FIRST_1.wav",
    "duration": 4.8,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_FIRST_2",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "국물이면 됐지. 외상도 되나?",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_JUMO_FIRST_2.wav",
    "duration": 2.85,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_FIRST_3",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "외상은 살아서 돌아오는 사람한테만 놓수.",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_FIRST_3.wav",
    "duration": 2.9,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_GAKSI_DONE_1",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "…끝났소?",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_GAKSI_DONE_1.wav",
    "duration": 1.05,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_GREET_1",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "어서 오시구려. 국물은 식기 전에 드시우.",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_GREET_1.wav",
    "duration": 2.85,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_GREET_2",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "또 오셨수? 산 얼굴 보니 반갑구먼.",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_GREET_2.wav",
    "duration": 3.2,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_GREET_3",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "도사 양반, 목이나 축이고 가시구려.",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_GREET_3.wav",
    "duration": 2.55,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_BUSY_1",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "요샌 내가 자리를 자주 비우우. 장 볼 데가 멀어서.",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_BUSY_1.wav",
    "duration": 3.4,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_BUSY_2",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "어딜 그리 다니냐고? …아낙 바쁜 데가 어디 한둘이우.",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_BUSY_2.wav",
    "duration": 3.95,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_RUMOR_1",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "들녘 쪽엔 함부로 가지 마시오. 그 주막 터에 뭔가 있다는 게 나만 하는 말이 아니오.",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_RUMOR_1.wav",
    "duration": 5.45,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_RUMOR_2",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "흑랑 굴 개들은 떼로 다니우. 한 놈 보이면 열 놈이라 치시구려.",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_RUMOR_2.wav",
    "duration": 4.15,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_RUMOR_3",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "쇠부리 폐광 사람들, 다 어디 갔는지… 밤마다 망치 소리만 난다우.",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_RUMOR_3.wav",
    "duration": 4.8,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_RUMOR_4",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "요새 밤이면 산길 끝에서 여우 우는 소리가 들려. …여우는 무슨. 바람이겠지.",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_RUMOR_4.wav",
    "duration": 6.2,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_RUMOR_5",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "내가 그 집서… 오래 일했지. 그 얘긴, 말은 못 하겠소.",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_RUMOR_5.wav",
    "duration": 4.15,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_OFFER_1",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "들녘 옛 주막 터 말이우. 밤이면 거기서 각시 하나가 운다오.",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_OFFER_1.wav",
    "duration": 4.1,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_OFFER_2",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "…울음이나 그치게 해 주시오. 그 집 얘긴 그것만 하면 됐수.",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_OFFER_2.wav",
    "duration": 3.9,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_OFFER_3",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "우는 사람 달래는 거라면 내가 좀 하지.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_JUMO_OFFER_3.wav",
    "duration": 3.1,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_JUMO_GAKSI_DONE_2",
    "speaker": "jumo",
    "text": "잘했소, 도사 양반. 그 집 얘기는 이제, 그만합시다.",
    "voice_name": "Junghee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5ebea1a364afaf00087fc2fb",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\jumo.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\jumo\\NPC_JUMO_GAKSI_DONE_2.wav",
    "duration": 3.65,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_MERCHANT_FIRST_1",
    "speaker": "merchant",
    "text": "어이구, 도사 양반. 이 난리 통에 장사가 되겠수?",
    "voice_name": "Sangdo",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02ce",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\merchant.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\merchant\\NPC_MERCHANT_FIRST_1.wav",
    "duration": 3.65,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_MERCHANT_FIRST_2",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "되게 해 드리지. 대신 값은 좀 깎고.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\merchant.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_MERCHANT_FIRST_2.wav",
    "duration": 3.0,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_MERCHANT_FIRST_3",
    "speaker": "merchant",
    "text": "허허, 벌써부터?",
    "voice_name": "Sangdo",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02ce",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\merchant.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\merchant\\NPC_MERCHANT_FIRST_3.wav",
    "duration": 1.7,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_MERCHANT_ACTIVE_1",
    "speaker": "merchant",
    "text": "굴에 드실 채비는 하셨수? 탕약 두 병은 챙겨 가시오.",
    "voice_name": "Sangdo",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02ce",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\merchant.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\merchant\\NPC_MERCHANT_ACTIVE_1.wav",
    "duration": 3.7,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_MERCHANT_ACTIVE_2",
    "speaker": "merchant",
    "text": "다녀오시면 내가 한잔 사리다. …장터가 열리면.",
    "voice_name": "Sangdo",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02ce",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\merchant.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\merchant\\NPC_MERCHANT_ACTIVE_2.wav",
    "duration": 3.45,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_MERCHANT_AFTER_1",
    "speaker": "merchant",
    "text": "장터가 다시 열릴 기미가… 보이네. 고맙수, 도사.",
    "voice_name": "Sangdo",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02ce",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\merchant.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\merchant\\NPC_MERCHANT_AFTER_1.wav",
    "duration": 3.45,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_MERCHANT_GREET_1",
    "speaker": "merchant",
    "text": "도사 양반, 갓끈이 풀렸수. 한 번 봐드릴까?",
    "voice_name": "Sangdo",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02ce",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\merchant.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\merchant\\NPC_MERCHANT_GREET_1.wav",
    "duration": 3.45,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_MERCHANT_GREET_2",
    "speaker": "merchant",
    "text": "오늘은 부적이 잘 안 팔리네. 도사 양반이라도 한 장…",
    "voice_name": "Sangdo",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02ce",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\merchant.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\merchant\\NPC_MERCHANT_GREET_2.wav",
    "duration": 3.6,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_MERCHANT_GREET_3",
    "speaker": "merchant",
    "text": "굴에서 건진 건 다 사 드리우. 값은… 뭐, 시세대로.",
    "voice_name": "Sangdo",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02ce",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\merchant.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\merchant\\NPC_MERCHANT_GREET_3.wav",
    "duration": 3.8,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_MERCHANT_GREET_4",
    "speaker": "merchant",
    "text": "술 찾으시우? 장터가 닫혀서 술은 없수. 물은 있지. …물은 공짜여.",
    "voice_name": "Sangdo",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02ce",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\merchant.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\merchant\\NPC_MERCHANT_GREET_4.wav",
    "duration": 4.75,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_MERCHANT_GREET_5",
    "speaker": "merchant",
    "text": "갓이야 덤으로 줘도 검 값은 못 깎아 주우. 목숨값이니.",
    "voice_name": "Sangdo",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02ce",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\merchant.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\merchant\\NPC_MERCHANT_GREET_5.wav",
    "duration": 4.25,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_1",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "도사 양반, 늦었소.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_1.wav",
    "duration": 1.1,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_2",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "할매, 술부터… 아, 분위기 아니구먼.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_2.wav",
    "duration": 3.05,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_3",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "봉인이 흔들리오. 못골 아래로 요기가 새고 있소.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_3.wav",
    "duration": 4.7,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_4",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "흑랑 굴 끝에 구미호의 수하가 자리를 잡았고, 봉밀굴 안은… 아직 잠든 것이 낫소.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_4.wav",
    "duration": 6.05,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_5",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "…또 봉인이여.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_5.wav",
    "duration": 1.5,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_6",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "도사 양반밖에 없소. 내려가 베어 주시오.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_6.wav",
    "duration": 3.25,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_7",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "술값은—",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_7.wav",
    "duration": 1.15,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_8",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "살아서 돌아오면 쳐 드리리다.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_8.wav",
    "duration": 2.5,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_HEAL_INTRO_1",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "그 전에 — 몸이나 성키 채워 드리리다. 이 몸한테는 값 안 받소.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_HEAL_INTRO_1.wav",
    "duration": 5.15,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_DONE_1",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "…왔구려.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_DONE_1.wav",
    "duration": 1.4,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_DONE_2",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "끝낸 것 같기도 하고.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_SHAMAN_DONE_2.wav",
    "duration": 1.9,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_DONE_3",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "봉인 기운이 달라졌소. 고맙소, 도사 양반.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_DONE_3.wav",
    "duration": 3.65,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_PROGRESS_1",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "아직이오? 흑랑 굴 끝 방이오.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_PROGRESS_1.wav",
    "duration": 3.05,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_PROGRESS_2",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "탕약은 챙겼소? 김 영감네 가보시오.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_PROGRESS_2.wav",
    "duration": 3.6,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LORE_1",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "그 조각, 본래 봉밀굴 문에 걸려 있던 봉인이오. 옛 도사들이 패·고리·사슬 셋으로 나눠 건 것이지.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LORE_1.wav",
    "duration": 7.7,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LORE_2",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "구미호가 그걸 거꾸로 걸어 제 문을 잠그고, 세 쪽을 흩어 놨소. 셋이 다시 모여야 문이 열리오.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LORE_2.wav",
    "duration": 7.25,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LORE_3",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "패는 제 개한테, 고리는 범한테… 사슬은 쇠 먹는 놈 뱃속에.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LORE_3.wav",
    "duration": 5.5,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LORE_4",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "남의 자물쇠로 제 집 문을 잠갔구먼. 뻔뻔하기는.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LORE_4.wav",
    "duration": 3.75,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_ALL_1",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "세 굴을 다 비웠구려. 이제 남은 건 하나뿐이오.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_ALL_1.wav",
    "duration": 4.0,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_ALL_2",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "…드디어.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_ALL_2.wav",
    "duration": 0.75,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_ALL_3",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "산길 끝 봉밀굴 문이오. 조각 셋을 대면 열릴 거요.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_ALL_3.wav",
    "duration": 4.25,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_HEUK_1",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "이제 남은 건 들녘 흑랑 굴 하나요.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_HEUK_1.wav",
    "duration": 3.15,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_HEUK_2",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "흑랑은 까막나라에서 넘어온 불개요. 해와 달도 물던 놈이니, 달려드는 걸 조심하시오.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_HEUK_2.wav",
    "duration": 6.8,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_HEUK_3",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "그래 봐야 강아지 한 마리구먼.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_HEUK_3.wav",
    "duration": 2.25,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_BEOM_1",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "이제 남은 건 정령재 범굴 하나요.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_BEOM_1.wav",
    "duration": 3.0,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_BEOM_2",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "굴 안에서 누가 도사 양반 이름을 부르거든, 그건 사람이 아니오.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_BEOM_2.wav",
    "duration": 4.85,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_BEOM_3",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "내 이름 부를 사람이 할매 말고 또 있었나.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_BEOM_3.wav",
    "duration": 3.0,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_SOE_1",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "이제 남은 건 정령재 쇠부리 폐광 하나요.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_SOE_1.wav",
    "duration": 3.75,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_SOE_2",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "쇠 냄새가 짙은 곳이오. 검이 안 들거든 불을 쓰시오.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_SOE_2.wav",
    "duration": 4.45,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_SOE_3",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "검 대신 불이라… 부적값이 또 나가겠구먼.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LAST_SOE_3.wav",
    "duration": 3.3,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LEFT_BEOM_SOE",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "남은 조각은 정령재 범굴하고 쇠부리 폐광에 있소. 어느 굴이 먼저든, 이번엔 더 무거운 게 나올 거요.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LEFT_BEOM_SOE.wav",
    "duration": 7.7,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LEFT_HEUK_SOE",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "남은 조각은 들녘 흑랑 굴하고 정령재 쇠부리 폐광에 있소. 어느 굴이 먼저든 상관없소.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LEFT_HEUK_SOE.wav",
    "duration": 7.1,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LEFT_HEUK_BEOM",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "남은 조각은 들녘 흑랑 굴하고 정령재 범굴에 있소. 어느 굴이 먼저든 상관없소.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_LEFT_HEUK_BEOM.wav",
    "duration": 7.3,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_4",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "그럼 술값도 더 챙기시오.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_SHAMAN_AFTER_4.wav",
    "duration": 2.3,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_GREET_1",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "도사 양반, 봉인이 흔들리오.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_GREET_1.wav",
    "duration": 2.6,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_GREET_2",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "못골 공기가 무겁소. 오래 머물 곳이 못 되오.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_GREET_2.wav",
    "duration": 4.15,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_GREET_3",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "구미호가 아직 잠든 게 다행이오.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_GREET_3.wav",
    "duration": 2.7,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_GREET_4",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "저 밑에서 올라온 것들은 기운을 읽어야 쓸 수 있소.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_GREET_4.wav",
    "duration": 4.35,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_REPEAT_1",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "말은 그만. 내려가시오.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_REPEAT_1.wav",
    "duration": 2.4,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_REPEAT_2",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "…술 이야기는 나중에.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_REPEAT_2.wav",
    "duration": 1.85,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_9",
    "speaker": "doho",
    "text": "…허. 하는 김에.",
    "voice_name": "Taewoo",
    "voice_id": "tc_6800a387534948f191cc952b",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\doho\\NPC_SHAMAN_OFFER_9.wav",
    "duration": 1.65,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_REPORT_3",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "봉인 셋째 자락까지 다시 여몄소. 한동안은 버틸 거요.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_REPORT_3.wav",
    "duration": 4.25,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_REPORT_2",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "봉인 둘째 자락도 다시 여몄소. 한동안은 버틸 거요.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_REPORT_2.wav",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_REPORT_1",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "봉인 첫 자락은 다시 여몄소. 한동안은 버틸 거요.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_REPORT_1.wav",
    "duration": 3.75,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_IDENTIFY_1",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "이건… 봉인 너머의 기운이 묻어 있구먼.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_IDENTIFY_1.wav",
    "duration": 3.25,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "NPC_SHAMAN_IDENTIFY_2",
    "speaker": "shaman",
    "text": "수수료는… 김 영감보다 싸오. 대신 잔소리요.",
    "voice_name": "GeumHee",
    "voice_id": "tc_5c789c337ad86500073a02cd",
    "source": "data\\dialogue\\npc\\shaman.dialogue",
    "file": "C:\\workspace\\joseon\\tmp\\audio559\\typecast\\shaman\\NPC_SHAMAN_IDENTIFY_2.wav",
    "duration": 3.65,
    "rate": 44100,
    "channels": 1
  }
]